                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">日前，</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">2021</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">年国际物理奥林匹克竞赛中国国家队选拔，在清华大学落下帷幕。我校</span></span><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">周天宇</span></span></strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">同学入选第</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">22</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">届亚洲物理奥林匹克竞赛（</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">APhO</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">）国家队，将代表中国参加亚洲物理奥林匹克竞赛。</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:center; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><a href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202101/2021012009005007.png" target="_blank"><img /> </a></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">据悉，该赛事是亚洲地区最为重要的物理学竞赛，每年举办一次，每次中国派</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">8</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">名队员参加。</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">这是继吴宇恺同学入选第</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">12</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">届亚洲物理奥林匹克竞赛国家队后，绍兴一中再次有学生入选这一顶级赛事。</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:center; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><a href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202101/2021012009021172.jpg" target="_blank"><img /> </a></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">周天宇同学表示，此次能入选竞赛国家队，会好好珍惜在更高平台上与顶级高手切磋学习的机会，一定争取优异的成绩，为国争光，为校添彩。</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:center; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><a href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202101/2021012009011034.jpg" target="_blank"><img /> </a></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">周天宇同学说：</span>“在考场上取得的每一分，背后都是我们刷过的一张张试卷，是老师讲解过的一道道题目，是我们的汗水浇铸，更是老师们的心血凝结。竞赛一路走来，走过省赛选拔、全国决赛、国家集训队</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">50</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">人集训选拔，走到今天见过了大场面，展望之后的国际赛场，我更真切地明白</span>‘路漫漫其修远兮，吾将上下而求索’的深刻内涵！”</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:center; MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><a href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202101/2021012009012557.png" target="_blank"><img /> </a></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">我校物理竞赛金牌教练、周天宇的指导老师黄伟中表示，</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">周天宇同学身上有物理竞赛生所共有的优点</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">——</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">热爱物理</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">，</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">思维敏捷</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">，</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">动手</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">能力强，</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">经得起挫折</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">，</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">有团队协作精神</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">；</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">更有一些他个性方面的优点</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">——</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">富</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">于</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">钻研精神，耐得住寂寞</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">，</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">有坚强的</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">意志力和</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">执行力</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">。</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">正是这些优点，使他走到了比大多数同学更远的地方。</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">黄伟中老师说：</span>“</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">在清华大学的集训队选拔期间，因为疫情老师无法进入校园，我只能在</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">QQ</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">上远程与</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">他</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">交流，他自控力强、执行力强的特点得到了充分的体现</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><span style="font-family:宋体">，是这次取得优异成绩的重要品质</span></span><span s